{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "piston-bore-30",
  "prompt": "做一个活塞-缸筒两件式直线机构：缸筒为盲底杯形件，活塞在孔内沿轴线走 30 mm 行程。两件必须能以独立实体分别导出，活塞能沿轴方向完全抽出，整个行程中不得与缸筒干涉。轴为 Z 轴、过原点；活塞直径 10 mm；孔与活塞的直径间隙必须落在 0.35 到 0.45 mm 之间。单位 mm，可直接 3D 打印。",
  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "barrel",
      "selector": "barrel"
    },
    {
      "id": "piston",
      "selector": "piston"
    }
  ],
  "joint": {
    "type": "prismatic",
    "axisOrigin": [
      0,
      0,
      0
    ],
    "axisDirection": [
      0,
      0,
      1
    ],
    "borePartId": "barrel",
    "movingPartId": "piston"
  },
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "distinct-exported-parts",
      "layer": "parts",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "equals",
        "value": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "diametral-clearance",
      "layer": "assembly",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "range",
        "min": 0.35,
        "max": 0.45,
        "unit": "mm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sampled-motion",
      "layer": "motion",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "equals",
        "value": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "disassembly-path",
      "layer": "assembly",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "equals",
        "value": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "source-motion",
      "layer": "motion",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "equals",
        "value": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "motion": {
    "strokeMm": [
      0,
      30
    ],
    "steps": 16
  },
  "disassembly": {
    "travelMm": 45,
    "steps": 10
  },
  "notes": [
    "Here the bore part is stationary and the shaft part moves, which is why joint.movingPartId is separate from joint.borePartId.",
    "For a prismatic joint the stroke and the withdrawal share a direction; the withdrawal is still a longer, separate sampling, not an independent axis.",
    "提交源码必须接受 pose.parameter 并以它为位姿：评测会按该参数重渲染，比较活动件质心与刚体变换，并确认固定件不随参数变化。"
  ],
  "pose": {
    "parameter": "piston_stroke",
    "unit": "mm",
    "values": [
      0,
      15,
      30
    ],
    "toleranceMm": 0.5
  }
}
